================================================================================
gitleaks default rule set (core/util/secretScan/rules.ts)
https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks, config/gitleaks.toml
================================================================================

Regular expressions and entropy thresholds for provider key formats are
ported, as data, from the gitleaks default configuration and converted from Go
(RE2) to JavaScript syntax. No gitleaks source code is included. Each rule's
`origin` field names the gitleaks rule it came from, or `own`.

